The I-SMF shall translate the SMF instructions into N4 instructions to send to the UL CL/BP and PSA2, for the UL and DL traffic in one or more PFCP Session Modification Request message(s) (the I-SMF has already created a PFCP session in the UL CL/BP and PSA2 in steps 2 and 3 of Figure 4.23.9.1-1 of TS 23.502 [29]). In particular:

